Rāvaṇa orders Akampana forth with all weapons after Dhūmrākṣa falls --- Akampana ignores drooping horses throbbing eye and shrieking beasts --- Hosts clash for Rāma and Rāvaṇa raising blinding red dust --- Blinded monkeys slay monkeys and demons slay demons in gloom --- Blood settles dust over corpse strewn earth --- Kumuda Nala Mainda and others ravage demon vanguard with trees